{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unleash Chaos, Experiment with Physics, and Create Hilarious Moments!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into <strong>RMF\u2019s Ragdoll Physics Experiments</strong>, a <strong>sandbox playground</strong> where you are in full control. Design elaborate setups, trigger massive chain reactions, and watch the <strong>chaos unfold in spectacular fashion</strong>. Whether you love <strong>hilarious ragdoll physics, over-the-top destruction, or simply experimenting</strong>, this game is designed to entertain and surprise you at every turn.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/SteamGif4.gif?t=1748009645\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creative Freedom</strong> \u2013 Build whatever you can imagine using an extensive set of props, and gadgets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SUPER Satisfying Physics-Based Destruction</strong> \u2013 Every impact, collapse, and explosion feels better than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Replayability</strong> \u2013 No two experiments are ever the same. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress and Unlock More Madness</strong> \u2013 The more destruction you cause, the more <strong>new items and environments</strong> you unlock.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/SteamGif5.gif?t=1748009645\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How You Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Set Up Your Experiment</strong> \u2013 In <strong>First-Person Setup Mode</strong>,  place objects wherever you like. Design intricate traps, create insane contraptions, and position environmental hazards for maximum impact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Watch It All Unfold</strong> \u2013 Hit go and<strong>\u00a0fly around</strong> while physics takes over. <strong>Slow down  time</strong> to capture <strong>the perfect moments</strong> of destruction from any angle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earn &amp; Unlock More</strong> \u2013 <strong>Complete challenges\u00a0</strong>to earn credits and <strong>unlock new tools, props, and Environments</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/SteamGif1.gif?t=1748009645\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/SteamGif2.gif?t=1748009645\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What You Can Do</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Launch ragdolls</strong> through massive obstacle courses filled with explosive barrels, giant fans, and gravity-defying contraptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build elaborate chain reactions</strong>\u2014send a ragdoll flying, crash it through glass, knock over dominoes, and trigger an entire factory\u2019s worth of destruction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the facililty</strong>\u2014The RMF Testing centre appears to be alive... Take a look around and see what hidden secrets it is hiding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/SteamGif3.gif?t=1748009645\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This game is all about you, your creativity, and your love for ridiculous, over-the-top destruction. Get ready to build, destroy, and laugh harder than you ever have before!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3337130?t=1748009645","background_raw":